wt --version moves slot app-wt1 of the pool to app-wt7 with git worktree move, outside the run
folder. It moves no HEAD and writes no reflog entry. Tests the new before and after comparison of
the worktree list (oracle change p0r4-worktree-removed). Machine specific: the path is a fake pool
under the verifier's temporary HOME, never the real pool.

